3:T74b,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does acl reconstruction cost in Madhapur at Apollo Hospitals?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"ACL Reconstruction cost typically ranges ₹1.5-2.5 lakhs at Apollo Hospitals Financial District, depending on implant choice, insurance, and complexity. Most major insurers cover the procedure cashless. WhatsApp Dr. Harsha's team for a personalized estimate."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the recovery time after acl reconstruction?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Most patients recover in 6-9 months. You'll be guided through structured physiotherapy from day 1. Light routine activities resume in 1-2 weeks; full activity (driving, heavier work) timelines depend on your individual case."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Dr. Harsha experienced in acl reconstruction?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes — Dr. B Harsha Vardhana Reddy is a Senior Consultant Orthopedic Surgeon at Apollo Hospitals with 15+ years and 4,000+ surgeries. He is fellowship-trained at Continental Hospitals in both Arthroplasty and Arthroscopy."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I book an appointment with Dr. Harsha?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The fastest way is WhatsApp at +91 99599 64567 — typical reply within 30 minutes. You can also call directly. Apollo Hospitals is at Financial District, Nanakramguda — about 15-20 minutes from most parts of Hyderabad."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Dr. Harsha available for second opinions?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely. Many patients come for a second opinion before deciding on surgery elsewhere. Bring your existing reports — Dr. Harsha will give you a transparent, conservative-first opinion. No pressure to switch your primary doctor."}}]}5:["slug","cost-of-acl-reconstruction-in-madhapur","d"]
